# Everything this site needs. Set real values in the Vercel dashboard, never in a file.
#
# RESEND_API_KEY  Sending key for the glazedweb.com verified domain in Resend.
# INQUIRY_TO      Where catering and special-order inquiries land. The client's real,
#                 human-monitored inbox, confirmed by the client before launch.
#                 Currently their public address is truenorthicecream@gmail.com.
# INQUIRY_FROM    Optional. Defaults to "True North Website <inquiries@glazedweb.com>".
# ORDER_TO        Optional. Where pickup orders land; falls back to INQUIRY_TO.
#                 Set it separately if the shops want orders in their own inbox.
# ORDER_FROM      Optional. Defaults to "True North Website <orders@glazedweb.com>".
RESEND_API_KEY=
INQUIRY_TO=
INQUIRY_FROM=
ORDER_TO=
ORDER_FROM=
